---
import AutoTranscriptDemoPlayer from '../components/AutoTranscriptDemo.svelte';

const manifestUrl = 'https://iiif.io/api/cookbook/recipe/0219-using-caption-file/manifest.json';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<title>annotations="auto" Demo - IIIF Transcript Player</title>
		<meta name="description" content="Demonstration of annotations=&quot;auto&quot;: the player builds its transcript from the IIIF manifest — embedded annotations first, else the canvas's WebVTT caption track — with no VTT parsing in the host." />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Crimson+Pro:wght@400;600;700;900&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
	</head>
	<body class="font-sans bg-parchment-100 bg-linen text-ink-900 antialiased">
		<!-- Navigation -->
		<nav class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 bg-parchment-50/95 backdrop-blur-sm border-b-2 border-ink-200">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
				<div class="flex items-center justify-between h-16">
					<div class="flex items-center">
						<a href="." class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-ink-900 tracking-tight">
							IIIF Transcript Player
						</a>
					</div>
					<div class="hidden md:flex items-center space-x-8">
						<a href="." class="text-ink-600 hover:text-terracotta-500 transition-colors font-medium">Home</a>
						<a href="https://github.com/umd-mith/iiif-timed-transcript" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-ink-600 hover:text-terracotta-500 transition-colors font-medium">
							GitHub
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<!-- Hero -->
		<section class="pt-32 pb-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b-2 border-ink-200">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
				<div class="text-sm font-mono text-terracotta-400 mb-6 tracking-wider">DEMO</div>
				<h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-bold text-ink-900 mb-6 leading-tight">
					Transcript from the Manifest
				</h1>
				<p class="text-xl text-ink-600 mb-4 max-w-3xl font-serif leading-relaxed">
					This demo passes <code class="font-mono text-sm bg-parchment-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">annotations="auto"</code> to <code class="font-mono text-sm bg-parchment-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">Root</code>. The host writes no VTT-parsing code: the player reads the transcript out of the IIIF manifest itself.
				</p>
				<p class="text-base text-ink-500 mb-8 max-w-3xl font-serif leading-relaxed">
					<code class="font-mono text-sm bg-parchment-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">"auto"</code> looks first for embedded <code class="font-mono text-sm bg-parchment-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">TextualBody</code> annotations on the canvas (the <a href="/iiif-timed-transcript/htmlannotations-demo" class="text-terracotta-500 hover:text-terracotta-600 underline">AVAnnotate shape</a>). When there are none — as in this IIIF Cookbook manifest — it fetches the canvas's external WebVTT <code class="font-mono text-sm bg-parchment-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">supplementing</code> track, reduces each cue to plain text, and builds the transcript from it. The status strip above the transcript reads <code class="font-mono text-sm bg-parchment-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">transcriptStatus</code> (<code class="font-mono text-sm bg-parchment-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">loading</code> → <code class="font-mono text-sm bg-parchment-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">ready</code>) from Root's children snippet. Because the transcript panel now shows the same text, <code class="font-mono text-sm bg-parchment-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">Viewer</code> hides the native caption track once per canvas so it isn't displayed twice.
				</p>

				<!-- How it works -->
				<div class="bg-parchment-200 border-2 border-ink-200 p-6 mb-8">
					<h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-bold text-ink-900 mb-3">How it works</h3>
					<pre class="text-sm font-mono overflow-x-auto text-ink-800"><code class="language-svelte">{`<script>
  import { IIIFPlayer } from '@umd-mith/iiif-timed-transcript';
</script>

<IIIFPlayer.Root {manifestUrl} annotations="auto">
  {#snippet children({ player })}
    <IIIFPlayer.Viewer />
    <IIIFPlayer.Controls>...</IIIFPlayer.Controls>

    <!-- "idle" | "loading" | "ready" | "error" -->
    <p>{player.transcriptStatus} · {player.annotations.length} segments</p>

    <!-- No annotations prop: Transcript reads them from Root -->
    <IIIFPlayer.Transcript>
      <IIIFPlayer.TranscriptSearch />
      <IIIFPlayer.TranscriptSegments />
    </IIIFPlayer.Transcript>
  {/snippet}
</IIIFPlayer.Root>`}</code></pre>
				</div>

				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 text-sm text-ink-500 border-t border-l-4 border-terracotta-300 pt-6 pl-6">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
						<div class="w-2 h-2 bg-terracotta-400 rotate-45"></div>
						<span class="font-medium">No VTT parsing in the host</span>
					</div>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
						<div class="w-2 h-2 bg-terracotta-400 rotate-45"></div>
						<span class="font-medium">Embedded annotations first, VTT second</span>
					</div>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
						<div class="w-2 h-2 bg-terracotta-400 rotate-45"></div>
						<span class="font-medium">transcriptStatus lifecycle</span>
					</div>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
						<div class="w-2 h-2 bg-terracotta-400 rotate-45"></div>
						<span class="font-medium">Captions hidden once per canvas</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Live Demo -->
		<section class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-parchment-50 border-b-2 border-ink-200">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
				<div class="mb-8">
					<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-ink-900 mb-4">
						Lunchroom Manners (IIIF Cookbook)
					</h2>
					<p class="text-lg text-ink-600 max-w-3xl font-serif leading-relaxed">
						The same manifest as the <a href="/iiif-timed-transcript/" class="text-terracotta-500 hover:text-terracotta-600 underline">home-page demo</a>, which parses the VTT by hand with <code class="font-mono text-sm bg-parchment-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">media-captions</code> and passes an <code class="font-mono text-sm bg-parchment-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">annotations</code> array. Here the array comes from the player.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-white border-2 border-ink-200 shadow-2xl p-6 md:p-10">
					<AutoTranscriptDemoPlayer client:load {manifestUrl} />
				</div>

				<div class="mt-6 text-sm text-ink-500">
					<p>
						Source manifest:
						<a href={manifestUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-terracotta-500 hover:text-terracotta-600 underline break-all">
							{manifestUrl}
						</a>
					</p>
					<p class="mt-2">
						Precedence and caveats (a manifest that carries both editorial notes and a VTT transcript shows the notes) are in the <a href="https://github.com/umd-mith/iiif-timed-transcript#annotations-auto-precedence" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-terracotta-500 hover:text-terracotta-600 underline">README</a>.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Footer -->
		<footer class="py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-ink-900 text-ink-400">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center">
				<p class="mb-4">
					Built by <a href="https://mith.umd.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-terracotta-400 hover:text-terracotta-300">Maryland Institute for Technology in the Humanities</a>
				</p>
				<p class="text-sm">
					Licensed under BSD-3-Clause-Clear • <a href="https://github.com/umd-mith/iiif-timed-transcript" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-terracotta-400 hover:text-terracotta-300">View on GitHub</a>
				</p>
			</div>
		</footer>
	</body>
</html>
